# PC card pc-melee-s2 (docs/plan-melee-top5.md, Stage 2, BENCH-110): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 6 seeds (3177-3182, after Stage 1's 3171-3176, so ef's two runs pool), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant. Template: s2prep writes work/melee-s2-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, g4, gc, g4gc, ef); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
